# Tour level 5, Hayes Valley & Alamo Square (data/tour.json), a 2-minute run from Hayes and Pierce:
# its three goals, the tape and S-K-A-T-E, each set up with a teleport after the bomb.
# - Bombed down Hayes tucked all the way (S, K, A, T on the street): Octavia 57.8 s after leaving
#   Pierce, Bomb Hayes in Under 60 (57.7 s before city phase 11's second export change).
# - Patricia's Green: from beside the first bench, a full ollie onto the second, a 50-50, ollie, a 50-50
#   on the short seat wall beyond it: Patricia's Green Line (a combo holding both PATRICIA'S BENCH and
#   PATRICIA'S SEAT WALL). Phase 26: this line replaced one that began with a teleport into the first
#   bench (thrown up out of it onto its top); a decent player does this one about half the time (feel
#   --tour), the old one 2%.
# - The first seat wall the whole way: E on it.
# - Up onto the steel sculpture's plinth from the road south of it, steering clear of the slabs:
#   the tape. (From 0.3 m further west since city phase 8: the green's ground moved by millimetres
#   and the old line ran into the east slab.)
# - Down the Alamo Square slope toward the Painted Ladies, rolling at 9 m/s 11 m before its steep last
#   stretch (the teleport and its speed stand in for the ride down), crouched, and the full ollie at its
#   edge: 1.2 s of air, Postcard Air. Phase 30: city 11 left the old line (from the top, a long push and
#   two ollies) at 28% for a decent player; its little hops over the slope's bumps let a human's timing
#   skip ahead to the one before the ollie (feel --tour follows a script by its moves). Then it rolls on
#   east to a stop, still in the level's area (the wrong-way hint the old line gave on the way out has
#   its own scenarios, tour-wrongway).
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run level hayes
hold up 10..300
hold ollie 300..6950
cmd 7400 teleport -219.88 431.31 9.75 352.9
cmd 7402 set skater.vel.x -0.5358
cmd 7402 set skater.vel.y 4.3067
hold ollie 7403..7427
tap grind 7429
tap grind 7436
tap grind 7442
tap grind 7448
tap grind 7454
tap grind 7460
tap grind 7466
tap grind 7472
hold ollie 7475..7510
tap grind 7514..7587 every 6
cmd 8000 teleport -218.9 416 9.75 350.7
cmd 8002 set skater.vel.x -0.7272
cmd 8002 set skater.vel.y 4.4409
hold ollie 8030..8060
tap grind 8064
tap grind 8070
tap grind 8076
tap grind 8082
tap grind 8088
tap grind 8094
tap grind 8100
tap grind 8106
tap grind 8112
tap grind 8118
tap grind 8124
tap grind 8130
tap grind 8136
tap grind 8142
tap grind 8148
tap grind 8154
cmd 8800 teleport -233.8 447.5 10.05 0
cmd 8830 set skater.vel.y 6.5
hold ollie 8868..8898
hold left 9012..9052
cmd 9400 teleport -1030 485.5 56.0 80
cmd 9402 set skater.vel.x 8.8
cmd 9402 set skater.vel.y 1.56
hold ollie 9403..9548
bot balance
run 14700
expect event levelStart{level=hayes,seconds=120} within 0..2
expect event letter{letter=S,have=S____} within 842..846
expect event letter{letter=T,have=SKAT_} within 3970..3974
expect event levelGoal{level=hayes,id=bomb60,name=Bomb Hayes in Under 60} within 6925..6929
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50 + PATRICIA'S BENCH + BS 50-50 + PATRICIA'S SEAT WALL,points=3240} within 7675..7675
expect event levelGoal{level=hayes,id=greenline,name=Patricia's Green Line} within 7675..7675
expect event letter{letter=E,have=SKATE} within 8317..8321
expect event levelGoal{level=hayes,id=skate} within 8317..8321
expect event tapeFound{level=hayes} within 8990..8994
expect event levelGoal{level=hayes,id=postcard,name=Postcard Air} within 9689..9693
expect event levelOver{level=hayes,score=3240,tape=true} within 14399..14402
expect session.levelGoals.length == 5 at end
expect no event bail
